codex
`flopscope` has only univariate normal functions, so exact nonzero bivariate covariance propagation is not available directly. I’m testing a cheaper full raw-second-moment Gaussian kernel propagation that keeps all pairwise second moments but treats preactivations as zero-mean; a very small blend may act as a control variate.
